BUNDLED DATA

The airport and airline datasets distributed with this package are derived
from sources that impose no redistribution restrictions:

  Airports — OurAirports (https://ourairports.com/data/)
             Released to the public domain. Credit is requested but not
             required, and is given here gladly.

  Airlines — Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org/), property P229
             Structured data is licensed CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain
             dedication).

aviation-names is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to IATA.
"IATA" is used only to name the code standards these datasets index.
